  "description": "Ristretto: The Ultimate Fast and Lean All-Roads Bike\nExperience unmatched performance with the Ristretto, a high-performance all-roads bike engineered for speed, strength, and versatility. Whether you're tackling a stage race or enjoying long-distance rides, this handcrafted masterpiece delivers exceptional quality and reliability.\nKey Features:\n\nOptimized for 700c wheels: Compatible with 28mm–35mm tires for a smooth, controlled ride on various terrains.\n\nPremium ACMUltra7 Aluminum Tubing: Made from zonally-butted 7005 aluminum for incredible rigidity and lightweight durability.\n\nAdvanced Tapered Design: Featuring a 1.5\" head-tube paired with an ENVE AR carbon fork for precision handling and superior stability.\n\nDisc Brakes with 12mm Thru-Axles: Flat-mount hydraulic disc brakes ensure responsive stopping power in all weather conditions.\n\nGenerous Tire Clearance and Fender Mounts: Perfect for all-road adventures or wet-weather rides.\n\nCustomizable Options:\n\nInternal Di2 electronic shifting compatibility\nHydraulic disc brake upgrade\n\nTake your all-road cycling to the next level with the Ristretto. Its innovative design, handcrafted details, and premium materials make it the perfect companion for riders who demand more from their bike.\n\nClick here to get your Co-Motion Ristretto order started!",
